    [x] [GuiControlNativeProbeTests](../VanillaExpanded.Tests/Integration/Gui/GuiControlNativeProbeTests.cs):
        InputChromeAndCallerPlaceholderUseEightUnitInsetWithoutEngineFieldAccess.
        Remove placeholder RGB and decorative inset checks; identify any independent
