    [x] [GuiControlNativeProbeTests](../VanillaExpanded.Tests/Integration/Gui/GuiControlNativeProbeTests.cs):
        PopupRestylesAfterNativeOpenSelectionAndListReplacementWithoutChangingRowGeometry.
        Remove popup fill/style checks; preserve open, selection, list replacement,
