    [x] [GuiControlNativeProbeTests](../VanillaExpanded.Tests/Integration/Gui/GuiControlNativeProbeTests.cs):
        TitleChromeCanBeOverpaintedLocallyWhileNativeDragPositionAndCloseRemainAuthoritative.
        Remove title-gradient samples; preserve drag, position persistence, and close behavior.

    Integration tooltip:
    [x] [RecipeBookNativeTooltipIntegrationTests](../VanillaExpanded.Tests/Integration/RecipeBook/RecipeBookNativeTooltipIntegrationTests.cs):
        RecipeTooltipUsesNativeSelectedGridWithTitleAndReleasesReplacedPreviews.
